     A* FLWCP - shop work centres, in build-flow sequence.  (GJA-917)
     A* Capacity is hours per day, which is what the load calculation
     A* divides remaining routed hours by.
     A*
     A                                      UNIQUE
     A          R FLWCR                     TEXT('Shop work centre')
     A            FLWCTR         6A         COLHDG('Work' 'Centre')
     A                                      TEXT('Work centre code')
     A            FLWCDESC      40A         COLHDG('Description')
     A                                      TEXT('Work centre name')
     A            FLWCSEQ        3P 0       COLHDG('Flow' 'Seq')
     A                                      TEXT('Sequence in build flow')
     A            FLWCCAP        5P 1       COLHDG('Capacity' 'Hrs/Day')
     A                                      TEXT('Capacity hours per day')
     A            FLWCCREW       3P 0       COLHDG('Crew')
     A                                      TEXT('Crew size')
     A            FLWCSHFT       1P 0       COLHDG('Shifts')
     A                                      TEXT('Shifts per day')
     A            FLWCSTAT       1A         COLHDG('Sts')
     A                                      TEXT('A=Active I=Inactive')
     A          K FLWCTR
